      <p>Every Veda Apothecary powder is one botanical in an 8 oz (227 g) resealable pouch — no additives, fillers or preservatives. Choose by goal: <a href="/collections/energy">Moringa for everyday energy</a>, <a href="/collections/calm">Ashwagandha for calm</a>, <a href="/collections/digestion">Triphala for digestion</a> or <a href="/collections/immunity">Amla for immunity and Vitamin C</a>*.</p>
      <p>Not sure where to begin? Read <a href="/blogs/journal/what-is-ayurveda">What is Ayurveda?</a> or <a href="/blogs/journal/read-a-supplement-label">how to read a supplement label</a>.</p>
